  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing National Food Security through Increased Rice Production Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at increasing the area under protective irrigation lowland rice production, doubling the productivity of small scale producers, facilitating the development of agro_processing and marketing for rice output from small scale producers, and providing smallholder rice producers steady access to improved inputs.</narrative>
  </description>
